 r←CheckDependencySettings config;key;name;value;msg
⍝ Checks the dependency settings "dependencies.tatin", "dependencies_dev.tatin" and "dependencies.nuget"
⍝ of the project `config` namespace.
⍝ Returns a vector of messages, one for each invalid setting; empty when all of them are valid.
⍝ "nuget" in "dependencies_dev" is permitted but not supported, so it is not checked.
 r←''
 :For key :In 'dependencies.tatin' 'dependencies_dev.tatin' 'dependencies.nuget'
     name←key↑⍨¯1+key⍳'.'
     :If '.tatin'≡¯6↑key
         value←name GetTatinDependencies config
     :Else
         value←name GetNuGetDependencies config
     :EndIf
     msg←⊃key ParseDependencySetting value
     :If 0<≢msg
         r,←⊂msg
     :EndIf
 :EndFor
⍝Done
